| `conceptual-workflows-doctrine-new` | `lore doctrine new` Behaviour | Full validation-order and failure-mode table for the two-file create path being replaced by `-d`/`-m` multi-file atomic create. |
| `conceptual-workflows-doctrine-show` | `lore doctrine show` Behaviour | Current verbatim two-file dump and JSON shape (`design`, `raw_yaml`, `steps`) — all three keys are removed by FR-*; replaced by design + mission index + `--mission`. |
| `conceptual-workflows-knight-crud` | Knight CRUD Operations | The whole command group being deleted; documents duplicate-detection, schema validation, soft-delete-by-rename patterns the new doctrine-mission model must reproduce for missions/. |
