| `tech-cli-entity-crud-matrix` | CLI Entity CRUD Matrix | Knight row removed; Doctrine row's create/update signatures change. **Stale**: already out of date on Codex ("✗ disk only" — `lore codex new/edit/delete` exist today, verified below). |
| `ref-lore_doctrine-module` | Lore doctrine module — internals | Documents `doctrine.py` internals (cycle detection, `_normalize`, two-file validation order) being replaced wholesale. |
