| `tech-arch-schemas` | Schemas Module Internals | `doctrine-yaml`, `doctrine-design-frontmatter`, `knight` schema kinds; overlay/merge machinery is untouched but the kind list shrinks by one and a `doctrine-mission-frontmatter` kind is added. |
