> Borderline included: `conceptual-workflows-mission-type`, `conceptual-workflows-init-reconcile`, `tech-arch-agents-md`, `tech-arch-skill-catalogue`, `preexisting-bugs-handoff` — all surfaced by `codex chaos` rather than direct search, all materially relevant.

